{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Y2K fever is running high as you near the end of 1999. While sitting at your computer on a rainy Friday night, you are unexpectedly led to play the game of <strong>Iskabon</strong>.   </i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/ba94cce231d31bd69142b2236d0548a2.poster.avif?t=1762324951\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/ba94cce231d31bd69142b2236d0548a2.webm?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/ba94cce231d31bd69142b2236d0548a2.mp4?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iskabon is a short and snappy\u00a0roguelike deckbuilder where each round lasts only a few minutes. As you progress, you build up your deck with quirky and often unexpected cards. Some cards affect other cards, some let you score higher, and some may even break the game. But...Be careful of the one card: <strong>The Iskabon</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round starts with a fixed number of Iskabons. Guess and avoid taking them. Or you will lose all the cards in your hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/fe29cf0eb03f529ef4135284bfd4f6ae.poster.avif?t=1762324951\" width=1056 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/fe29cf0eb03f529ef4135284bfd4f6ae.webm?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/fe29cf0eb03f529ef4135284bfd4f6ae.mp4?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round ends with you playing the cards in your hand. Your goal is to play a hand that scores enough points to advance to the next round. And here is your chance to strategize - cards in your hand get played from left to right, as earlier cards affect later ones. Be sure to reorder your hand using the intuitive drag-and-drop interface to maximize impact and score big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/e6cc5d93e9c70e5d24594afb8b9bee22.poster.avif?t=1762324951\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/e6cc5d93e9c70e5d24594afb8b9bee22.webm?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/e6cc5d93e9c70e5d24594afb8b9bee22.mp4?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the cash you earn to buy better cards at the shop. There are <strong>over 40</strong>\u00a0different cards to have! Or you can buy one of the many other special Items that grant you one-time power-ups during the game. How you want to proceed is up to you. The only thing that matters is to <strong>SURVIVE</strong>. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024470?t=1762324951","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024470?t=1762324951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/cd69d24db377ce90ac3788128b1949b9aa7facb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762324951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/cd69d24db377ce90ac3788128b1949b9aa7facb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762324951","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Y2K fever is running high as you near the end of 1999. While sitting at your computer on a rainy Friday night, you are unexpectedly led to play the game of <strong>Iskabon</strong>.   </i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/ba94cce231d31bd69142b2236d0548a2.poster.avif?t=1762324951\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/ba94cce231d31bd69142b2236d0548a2.webm?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/ba94cce231d31bd69142b2236d0548a2.mp4?t=1762324951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iskabon is a short and snappy\u00a0roguelike deckbuilder where each round lasts only a few minutes. As you progress, you build up your deck with quirky and often unexpected cards. Some cards affect other cards, some let you score higher, and some may even break the game. But...Be careful of the one card: <strong>The Iskabon</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round starts with a fixed number of Iskabons. Guess and avoid taking them. Or you will lose all the cards in your hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/fe29cf0eb03f529ef4135284bfd4f6ae.poster.avif?t=1762324951